# Cursor interpreter workflow

- Prefer reusing the local interpreter session instead of asking the user to restate context.
- If user says to route/sync a prompt, use `scripts/cursor-interpreter.cmd`.
- Keep one active session per topic (e.g., Czedr, CQ Athletes, security).
- Save stable project context into the interpreter session system prompt once.
- Use broadcast mode only when user asks to compare multiple backends.
- For quick reuse:
  - `scripts/cursor-interpreter.cmd -Message "your message"`
  - `scripts/cursor-interpreter.cmd -NewSession -Message "new thread context"`
